 to the wall and begins sealing him alive behind a stone wall, layer by layer, with meticulous precision, ensuring that Fortunato is trapped in silence and darkness.\\n\\nThe climax occurs when Amontillado completes the wall, reassembles the original bone pile to restore the catacombs’ appearance, and leaves Fortunato’s body undisturbed for fifty years. The story ends with Amontillado reflecting on the success of his revenge, emphasizing that he has achieved his goal with perfect impunity. The key relationship between Amontillado and Fortunato is defined by a personal betrayal and a transformation from adversaries to a chillingly intimate act of vengeance. The turning point is the moment when Fortunato’s laughter fades into silence, marking the irreversible end of his life and the fulfillment of Amontillado’s vow.\\n\",\n      \"themes\": [\n        \"revenge\",\n        \"isolation\",\n        \"moral ambiguity\"\n      ],\n      \"narrative_style\": \"first-person retrospective\"\n    },\n    \"model_usage\": {\n      \"Chapter Detection\": {\n        \"model\": \"qwen3:30b-instruct\",\n        \"provider\": \"ollama\"\n      },\n      \"Character Extraction\": {\n        \"model\": \"qwen3-next:80b-a3b-instruct-q8_0\",\n        \"provider\": \"ollama\"\n      },\n      \"Chapter Summaries\": {\n        \"model\": \"qwen3-next:80b-a3b-instruct-q8_0\",\n        \"provider\": \"ollama\"\n      },\n      \"Character Profiles\": {\n        \"model\": \"qwen3:4b-instruct\",\n        \"provider\": \"ollama\"\n      },\n      \"Pronunciation Guide\": {\n        \"model\": \"qwen3:30b-instruct\",\n        \"provider\": \"ollama\"\n      }\n    },\n    \"timing\": {\n      \"Chapter Detection\": {\n        \"duration_seconds\": 67.72,\n        \"duration_formatted\": \"1m 8s\"\n      },\n      \"Character Extraction\": {\n        \"duration_seconds\": 100.04,\n        \"duration_formatted\": \"1m 40s\"\n      },\n      \"Chapter Summaries\": {\n        \"duration_seconds\"